                <invention-title lang="de">ZUGANGSPUNKT, STATION UND DRAHTLOSKOMMUNIKATIONSVERFAHREN</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">POINT D'ACCÈS, STATION ET PROCÉDÉ DE COMMUNICATION SANS FIL</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">ACCESS POINT, STATION, AND WIRELESS COMMUNICATION METHOD</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>An access point (AP), a station (STA), and a wireless communication method are provided. The wireless communication method includes determining, by an AP, a criterion for latency sensitive traffic and determining, by the AP, one or more traffic stream identifiers (TSIDs) for TS-based latency sensitive traffic comprising a TS with a particular traffic specification (TSPEC), wherein the TSPEC comprises extended parameters. The wireless communication method further includes setting up, by the AP, a restricted target wake time (TWT) for the one or more TSIDs. This can issues in the prior art, support a TS operation for latency sensitive traffic, provide good communication performance, and/or provide high reliability.</p>
            </abstract>
